    <h1 class="article-title">RuPay, UPI, and the Data Behind Explosive Growth</h1>
    <p class="article-dek">A business intelligence case study: how RuPay's UPI integration turned distribution analytics and real-time transaction data into explosive adoption — and what it means for any fintech or SaaS business tracking customer acquisition analytics.</p>

    <div class="article-byline">
      <div class="article-avatar" style="background:#2E3A55;">LI</div>
      <div>
        <div class="article-author">Lindsay</div>
        <div class="article-role">Consultant, Tycoon Clap</div>
      </div>
      <div class="article-time">7 min read</div>
    </div>

